Night at the Museum: Battle of the Smithsonian is a adventure,
fantasy, action film directed by Shawn Levy.

3
00:16:34,736 --> 00:16:40,736
Hapless museum night watchman Larry Daley must help his living, breathing exhibit friends out of a
pickle now that they've been transferred to the archives at the Smithsonian Institution.

4
00:22:06,315 --> 00:22:12,315
Larry's (mis)adventures this time include close encounters with
Amelia Earhart, Abe Lincoln and Ivan the Terrible.

5
