11
01:00:47,368 --> 01:00:53,368
Night at the Museum: Battle of the Smithsonian is a 2009 American fantasy comedy film
directed by Shawn Levy, and written by Robert Ben Garant and Thomas Lennon.

12
01:06:18,947 --> 01:06:24,947
The film stars Ben Stiller, Amy Adams, Owen Wilson, Hank Azaria,
Christopher Guest, Alain Chabat and Robin Williams.

13
01:11:50,526 --> 01:11:56,526
It is the second film in the Night at the Museum series,
following Night at the Museum (2006).

14
01:17:22,105 --> 01:17:28,105
The film was theatrically released on May 22, 2009, by 20th Century Fox.

15
01:22:53,684 --> 01:22:59,684
It received mixed reviews and became a box-office success,
grossing $413 million on a $150 million budget.

16
01:28:25,263 --> 01:28:31,263
A third film, Night at the Museum: Secret of the Tomb, was released in 2014, and an animated
sequel, Night at the Museum: Kahmunrah Rises Again, was released in 2022.

17
01:33:56,842 --> 01:34:02,842
The film explores themes of museum, magical object,
duringcreditsstinger, pharaoh, amelia earhart.

